category: Libs
requires: cygwin
sdesc: "POSIX-C Library for handling Linear/Logitudinal Time Code (runtime)"
ldesc: "Linear (or Longitudinal) Timecode (LTC) is an encoding of timecode data as a
Manchester-Biphase encoded audio signal. The audio signal is commonly recorded
on a VTR track or other storage media."
external-source: libltc

